config BR2_PACKAGE_TENSORRT_RUNTIME
	bool "tensorrt runtime"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_TEGRA_LIBS
	help
	  TensorRT 10.16 runtime libraries, the ONNX parser, trtexec, and
	  the CUDA runtime (cudart 13.2) from NVIDIA's JetPack 7.2 apt
	  feed. TensorRT 10 needs no cuDNN. trtexec is the GPU smoke
	  test: it can build and run an engine from an ONNX model with
	  nothing else installed (docs/m4-cuda.md).
